  "description": "FNIRSAtlas is a large-scale benchmark suite for near-infrared spectroscopy (NIRS) analysis. It provides a unified pipeline that automates everything from data download to preprocessing and analysis. Users can easily test custom models on the included datasets using standardized evaluation protocols, supporting both classical and deep learning methods.",
